## 8. MCP surface (keep it small)

**Resources**
- `palette` — the shared palette
- `design-guide`, `intensity-rubric`, `reference-rooms`

**Tools**
- `get_level` — whole level YAML, or a named region/set of spaces
- `apply_commands` — batch of commands as one transaction, with a label
- `begin_proposal` / `commit_proposal` / `discard_proposal` — or fold into `apply_commands` with a `proposal` flag (decide during build)
- `check_reachability` — reachable spaces from a start, given a set of abilities; reports gates, one-way flow, entry points per space
- `check_structure` — softlocks, dead ends, unreachable spaces, hidden connections without a telegraph
- `render_map` — PNG of the current level (optionally a floor / elevation layer, optionally with a proposal overlaid) so the model can look at its work
- `list_notes` — open notes as work items

